+## Overview
+
+Total revenue for the 30 orders recorded between May 2 and May 21, 2026 was
+$7,154.44. The average order was worth about $238.48, and the median order
+value was $204.95.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads all products with $2,392.00 in revenue from just 16 units sold,
+thanks to its $149.50 price. Widget follows at $2,118.94, Doohickey at
+$1,513.00, and Sprocket at $1,130.50. Sprocket moves the most units (238)
+but its $4.75 price keeps it last in revenue.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North leads all regions at $2,176.35, followed by East at $1,830.79 and
+South at $1,732.48. West trails at $1,414.82, about $761.53 behind North,
+and placed only one Gadget order during the period.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Prioritize Gadget stock and promotions; it produces the most revenue ($2,392.00) from only 16 units sold.
+- Investigate West's weak sales; it trails North by $761.53 with fewer high-value orders than other regions.
+- Bundle the high-volume, low-price Sprocket (238 units, $1,130.50) with pricier items to raise average order value.
